a gravitational-wave signal consistent with the merger of two
black holes with masses
137{\ensuremath{-}}18+23M{\ensuremath{\odot}} and
101{\ensuremath{-}}50+22M{\ensuremath{\odot}} (90\% credible
intervals), at a luminosity distance of 0.7─4.1 Gpc, a redshift
of 0.40{\ensuremath{-}}0.25+0.27, and with a network signal-to-
noise ratio of {\ensuremath{\sim}}20.7. Both black holes exhibit
high spins{\textemdash}0.90{\ensuremath{-}}0.19+0.10 and
